OL,3,GNEWSAFigures show scale of county's
OL,4,Ablue badge misuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FJust 10 of the 120 people in Norfolk
OL,7,Freported for misusing blue badges in
OL,8,Fthe last financial year were
OL,9,Fprosecuted, figures show.
OL,11,FCourt action by the county council
OL,12,Fresulted in rule-breakers being ordered
OL,13,Fto pay #10,326 in fines and costs,
OL,14,Faccording to an annual report by its
OL,15,Fblue badge investigator.
OL,17,FGraham Footer, chief executive of
OL,18,Fcharity Disabled Motoring UK, said
OL,19,Fenforcement was vital and he warned
OL,20,Fthat misuse of disabled bays was a
OL,21,Fproblem in car parks that were not
OL,22,Fmonitored by inspectors.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
